OL,3,GNEWSACouncils ask not to be left out of
OL,4,Anew powers for Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh councils should not be "left
OL,7,Fbehind" when it comes to further
OL,8,Fdevolution, Wales' most senior
OL,9,Fcouncillor has warned.
OL,11,FAnthony Hunt, leader of the Welsh Local
OL,12,FGovernment Association (WLGA), said
OL,13,Fcouncil involvement would be
OL,14,F"essential" to grow Wales' economy.
OL,16,FHis comments came after Prime Minister
OL,17,FAndy Burnham's pledge to devolve more
OL,18,Fpower to English regions.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
