OL,3,GNEWSACouncils ask not to be left out of
OL,4,Anew powers for Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FHunt said that in the past there had
OL,7,Fbeen a tendency to equate devolution
OL,8,Fwith more powers for Cardiff Bay rather
OL,9,Fthan for Wales' own regions.
